 }\n      }, {\n        &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Dave Banerjee&quot;,\n        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&lt;p class=\\&quot;\\&quot; data-rte-preserve-empty=\\&quot;true\\&quot; style=\\&quot;white-space:pre-wrap;\\&quot;&gt;COMPUTE POLICY&lt;\\/p&gt;&lt;p class=\\&quot;\\&quot; data-rte-preserve-empty=\\&quot;true\\&quot; style=\\&quot;white-space:pre-wrap;\\&quot;&gt;Dave is a Research Associate on the Compute Policy team, focusing on AI integrity, AI security and governance, and AI-driven power concentration. He is also a research manager at ERA Cambridge in the technical AI governance stream. Dave is an alumni of the IAPS Policy Fellowship, and prior to joining IAPS he participated in the GovAI summer fellowship, ARENA (Alignment Research Engineer Accelerator), and SPAR (Supervised Program for Alignment Research).&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,\n        &quot;button&quot;: {\n          &quot;buttonText&quot;: &quot;Read Bio&quot;\n        },\n        &quot;imageId&quot;: &quot;69d55027c3f5387563be50a1&quot;,\n        &quot;image&quot;: {\n          &quot;id&quot;: &quot;69d55027c3f5387563be50a1&quot;,\n          &quot;recordType&quot;: 2,\n          &quot;addedOn&quot;: 1775587367675,\n          &quot;updatedOn&quot;: 1775587367712,\n          &quot;workflowState&quot;: 1,\n          &quot;publishOn&quot;: 1775587367675,\n          &quot;authorId&quot;: &quot;696fbff22f7f2d6fe7ef6507&quot;,\n          &quot;systemDataId&quot;: &quot;10772c55-2f4c-4bd8-8687-65652bca6a17&quot;,\n          &quot;systemDataVariants&quot;: &quot;5472x3648,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w&quot;,\n          &quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;: &quot;JPG&quot;,\n          &quot;filename&quot;: &quot;IAPS Headshots - Jason Dixson Photography - 251022 - 230354 - 8425.jpg&quot;,\n          &quot;mediaFocalPoint&quot;: {\n            &quot;x&quot;: 0.5,\n            &quot;y&quot;: 0.5,\n            &quot;source&quot;: 3\n          },\n          &quot;colorData&quot;: {\n            &quot;topLef