rom enterprises shipping to production, to researchers pushing new capabilities, to organizations responsible for safety at scale.</p></div><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="rtf-white w-richtext"><p class="text-primary">This is work with real consequences. Looking for a place where your thinking carries weight and where progress is measured in outcomes, not meetings? <strong>You’ll find it here.</strong></p></div><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section class="bg-subtle"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_096ccd17-9373-8cda-aef6-e666105c0ac3-d72d58a1"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Support That Lets You Do Your Best Work</h2><p>Our benefits are designed to support real life, sustained curiosity, and the kind of deep work that meaningful impact requires.</p></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-sm"><div class="_2x-grid landscape"><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>28 days off between holidays &amp;\xa0PTO:\xa0</strong>Time off that actually feels like time off.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>401(k) with up to 4% matching: </strong>We invest in the long term; yours included.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Flexible work arrangements: </strong>We care about outcomes, not where your laptop happens to be.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Professional development support: </strong>Learning isn’t optional here. We make room for it.</li></ul></div><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>Medical, dental, and vision coverage: </strong>Comprehensive coverage, because your health isn’t a side project.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Catered lunches (Pittsburgh office): </strong>Good food, fewer decisions, better afternoons.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Visa sponsorship</strong>:<strong> </strong>Great work knows no borders. We’ll help with the paperwork.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Short-term disability &amp; parental support: </strong>100% paid, including parental leave, with up to 14 weeks of paid birthing leave. So you can focus on what matters most.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-lg"></div></div></section><section id="open-positions"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_4b80b22b-42ff-875c-a016-a3c601446255-d72d58a1"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Do the Work That Matters</h2><p>If you’re excited by meaningful problems, real responsibility, and work that shows up in the world, you’ll fit right in. Take a look at our open roles below.</p></div></div><div class="w-embed"><div id="ashby_embed"></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-md"></div></div><div class="border-default"></div></section><div class="border-default"></div><section class="newsletter-bg overflow-hidden" id="joinNewsletter"><div class="padding-global relative"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="div-block-89"><div class="div-block-90"><h2 class="heading-medium">Join our newsletter</h2><div class="padding-xxs"></div><p class="textwrap-balance">Keep up to date on all things Gray Swan and AI\xa0Security.</p></div><div class="form-div"><div><div class="w-embed w-script">\n</div></div></div></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div></div></section><div class="w-embed w-script"></div>\n</body>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
