 grid-cols-4 gap-x-site-grid-gutter h-full col-span-2 sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1"><div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-y-4 lg:col-span-3"><h2 class="type-sans-h4 text-pretty">CFR Culture</h2><div class="rich-text prose type-serif-body4 text-pretty"><p class="culture__text">CFR is a collaborative, diverse, and inclusive workplace. We value enthusiasm, ideas, and drive. Committed to a healthy work/life balance, many positions allow for hybrid work. CFR also offers a wide variety of staff events ranging from lunches with policy experts, professional development opportunities, summer Fridays, and events through our award-winning health and wellness initiative.</p>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="grid-cols-site gap-x-site-grid-gutter px-site-margin grid grid-rows-1" data-block="asset_and_text"><div class="lg:row-start-1 lg:row-end-1 col-span-full"><div class="grid auto-rows-auto grid-cols-2 gap-site-grid-gutter sm:grid-cols-4"><div class="col-span-2 has-data-[orientation=vertical]:col-span-1 sm:col-start-3 sm:row-start-1"><figure class="@container"><img alt="CFR Website Banner 20160426_0" class="object-cover transition-opacity duration-500 starting:opacity-0 aspect-3/2 w-full overflow-hidden max-h-asset-max-height" data-orientation="horizontal" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" height="428" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="https://assets.cfr.org/images/t_cfr_3_2/f_auto/w_1920/v1755715534/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb.jpg" srcset="https://assets.cfr.org/images/t_cfr_3_2/f_auto/w_320/v1755715534/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb.jpg 320w, https://assets.cfr.org/images/t_cfr_3_2/f_auto/w_480/v1755715534/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb.jpg 480w, https://assets.cfr.org/images/t_cfr_3_2/f_auto/w_640/v1755715534/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb/CFR-Website-Banner-20160426_0_42057cbeb.jpg 640w, https